	'ab_a_b' => 'Find the college at Pier 3, 4 Quay Road, Port Ellery. The office phone is +00 0000 0000 and the email is admissions@hatoba-college.example. Office hours are Monday to Friday, 08:30 to 17:00. The quay is open to visitors on the first Saturday of the month, 10:00 to 13:00, and the next of those Saturdays is 6 February 2027. The college is closed on Sundays and public holidays. The training berth, the simulator, the engine room workshop and the sea-survival pool are all reached from this pier. Letters, invoices and berth confirmations use the same address. There is no second campus and no city office listed.',
