	'ab_p_b' => 'I am Captain Mara Lindqvist, Principal of Hatoba College. I have 26 years at sea, and the college I lead has been on Pier 3 since 1987. We take 18 cadets on a Harbour Foundation intake so that a chart correction and a line on the quay can still be watched properly. I will not tell you at enquiry that a berth is yours. If a berth is arranged, you receive it in writing on the Friday of week 12, after the assessment. For the intake of 12 January 2027, that assessment is 26 March 2027 and that letter is dated 2 April 2027. Come to the interview with your medical and your eyesight test. I would rather a small cohort and a clear letter than a large promise.',
