	'as_e_b' => 'Use the enquiry form on this page, or email admissions@hatoba-college.example. The form asks for your name, your email, a phone number if you want to leave one, the intake you are considering (January, April or September), a message, and a consent tick. The mail button is labelled Email admissions and opens a letter to the same address with the subject of an intake enquiry. Say which programme you mean, and whether you need to ask about the bursary or the two instalments. The office phone is +00 0000 0000 during Monday to Friday, 08:30 to 17:00. Sending an enquiry does not reserve one of the 18 places. A place exists only when step four is confirmed in writing.',
