	'as_t3_b' => 'The college runs three intakes a year, in January, April and September, with 18 cadets on each Harbour Foundation intake. The intake date written for the coming foundation course is 12 January 2027. Assessment for that intake is 26 March 2027. Berth confirmation for that intake is 2 April 2027, the Friday of week 12, after the assessment. April and September intakes follow the same twelve-week shape for Harbour Foundation. Their calendar dates are given in the offer and in college news, not guessed from the January set. Bridge Watch Rating is 8 weeks, Engine Room Rating is 10 weeks, and Deck Officer Preparation is 24 weeks. Each offer states the start that belongs to that programme.',
