	'as_t5_b' => 'A place is confirmed at step four, in writing, after the enquiry, the medical and eyesight check, and the interview at Pier 3. The letter names the programme, the intake month, and the two instalments. The EUR 90 deposit is counted in that fee. Until the letter exists, you are an applicant, including if you have walked the quay on an open Saturday or sat the interview the same week. Place confirmed is not the same sentence as berth confirmed. The berth, if one is arranged, is confirmed later, in writing, on the Friday of week 12, after the assessment. For the 12 January 2027 intake that Friday date is 2 April 2027.',
