	'site_title' => 'Hatoba College',
	'st1_c' => 'The cadet learns the paper chart, the rules of the road and how to plot a bearing on the training bridge.',
	'st1_l' => 'Stage 1',
	'st1_o' => 'The college teaches shore school at Pier 3, with the quay, the cranes and a tug visible through the bridge windows.',
	'st1_t' => 'Shore school',
	'st1_w' => 'Weeks 1–4',
	'st2_c' => 'The cadet stands a watch on the full-mission bridge simulator and talks it through at the debrief.',
	'st2_l' => 'Stage 2',
	'st2_o' => 'The college runs the simulator and holds that debrief after each watch.',
	'st2_t' => 'Simulator bridge',
	'st2_w' => 'Weeks 5–7',
	'st3_c' => 'The cadet keeps harbour watch from the quay and the training berth, following the traffic of Port Ellery.',
	'st3_l' => 'Stage 3',
	'st3_o' => 'Instructors stand the watch with the cadet and set the work for the day.',
